    {
      "subId": "7303220",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "730322001"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "730322001": {
            "id": "730322001",
            "speakerId": 20656,
            "speakerName": "Arakavi",
            "text": "Golden Nara, we shall sing together! Please take the lead!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7303221",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "730322101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "730322101": {
            "id": "730322101",
            "speakerId": 20666,
            "speakerName": "Arasudraka",
            "text": "May this song echo in Vanarana forever!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7303211",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Arakavi",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "730321101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "730321101": {
            "id": "730321101",
            "speakerId": 20649,
            "speakerName": "Arapacati",
            "text": "Nara's \"taste of happiness\" is so strange... But since Nara is happy, Arapacati and her brothers shall be happy too!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730321102"
            ]
          },
          "730321102": {
            "id": "730321102",
            "speakerId": 20651,
            "speakerName": "Arasaka",
            "text": "The \"taste of happiness\" is good, of course. B—But it's not just about the sugar.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730321103"
            ]
          },
          "730321103": {
            "id": "730321103",
            "speakerId": 20650,
            "speakerName": "Arachatora",
            "text": "The Head Mushroom helped too! The Head Mushroom I've always dreamed about! Its aroma... Ahh!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730321104"
            ]
          },
          "730321104": {
            "id": "730321104",
            "speakerId": 20653,
            "speakerName": "Araphala",
            "text": "And don't... don't forget about the Unrivaled Fresh Fruit...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730321105"
            ]
          },
          "730321105": {
            "id": "730321105",
            "speakerId": 16765,
            "speakerName": "Arapas",
            "text": "Water from Vanarana too! Soup with \"the taste of happiness\" can only be made with the best water!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7303225",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Arakavi",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "730320201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "730320201": {
            "id": "730320201",
            "speakerId": 20656,
            "speakerName": "Arakavi",
            "text": "Hey, it's the Golden Nara! Perfect timing!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730320204"
            ]
          },
          "730320204": {
            "id": "730320204",
            "speakerId": 20656,
            "speakerName": "Arakavi",
            "text": "Gold is a wonderful color, the same as sunshine. That's what I'd like to call you on this important occasion!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730320205"
            ]
          },
          "730320205": {
            "id": "730320205",
            "speakerId": 20666,
            "speakerName": "Arasudraka",
            "text": "#Regardless, your name shall be recorded in our songs. Nara {NICKNAME} is a good name, very lyrical!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730320206"
            ]
          },
          "730320206": {
            "id": "730320206",
            "speakerId": 20667,
            "speakerName": "Aradasa",
            "text": "♪~",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730320207"
            ]
          },
          "730320207": {
            "id": "730320207",
            "speakerId": 20665,
            "speakerName": "Arayasa",
            "text": "#\"The {M#boy}{F#girl} whose eyes and soul are as golden as the sun, thy name is Nara {NICKNAME}.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730320208"
            ]
          },
          "730320208": {
            "id": "730320208",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hey, what about Paimon? Don't forget Paimon now!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730320209"
            ]
          },
          "730320209": {
            "id": "730320209",
            "speakerId": 20665,
            "speakerName": "Arayasa",
            "text": "\"The pearl in moonlight, pure as silver, thy name is Paimon...\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730320210"
            ]
          },
          "730320210": {
            "id": "730320210",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Yes, Paimon wants to hear more! Maybe something that lauds our friendship too..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7303205",
      "subQuestName": "Play a melody by the stage",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "730320501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "730320501": {
            "id": "730320501",
            "speakerId": 20646,
            "speakerName": "Arama",
            "text": "Actually, I've been wanting to ask you something. Why do Nara sleep?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730320505",
              "730320504"
            ]
          },
          "730320505": {
            "id": "730320505",
            "speakerId": 20646,
            "speakerName": "Arama",
            "text": "I see! Aranara \"hibernate\" only when a great, great danger is present. We turn into tiny seeds and go into dreamless slumbers.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730320506"
            ]
          },
          "730320506": {
            "id": "730320506",
            "speakerId": 20646,
            "speakerName": "Arama",
            "text": "But we will be isolated from others, and that's rather scary. Not to mention having to accumulate a lot of memories to change back into our previous forms...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730320507"
            ]
          },
          "730320507": {
            "id": "730320507",
            "speakerId": 20646,
            "speakerName": "Arama",
            "text": "But you Nara are different. You must sleep often, and that's the only way you can dream. Dreams are precious, so I understand... But it is strange. You have had very few dreams lately, big Nara...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730320508"
            ]
          },
          "730320508": {
            "id": "730320508",
            "speakerId": 20646,
            "speakerName": "Arama",
            "text": "Regardless, you can sleep here without worries. We will guard your dreams and stop bad things like Vanagni from getting in.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730320509"
            ]
          },
          "730320509": {
            "id": "730320509",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Sounds good, but...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730320510"
            ]
          },
          "730320510": {
            "id": "730320510",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Gah, you and your mentions of dreams... Paimon almost feels like meeting you and spending the festival with you might just all be a dream Paimon had after eating those mushrooms, and that all this will vanish once Paimon wakes up...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730320511"
            ]
          },
          "730320511": {
            "id": "730320511",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Will we still see you when we wake up?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730320512"
            ]
          },
          "730320512": {
            "id": "730320512",
            "speakerId": 20646,
            "speakerName": "Arama",
            "text": "Of course!"
          },
          "730320504": {
            "id": "730320504",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#Eh? Don't you think sleep is pretty comfortable, {NICKNAME}?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7303209",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "730320901"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "730320901": {
            "id": "730320901",
            "speakerId": 20577,
            "speakerName": "Aragaru",
            "text": "Hehe, Festival Utsava, so lively! Vanarana is filled with joy!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730320902"
            ]
          },
          "730320902": {
            "id": "730320902",
            "speakerId": 20576,
            "speakerName": "Aranakin",
            "text": "But Festival Utsava will end. Nara friends of Aranara might leave too.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730320903"
            ]
          },
          "730320903": {
            "id": "730320903",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "The forest will remember.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730320904"
            ]
          },
          "730320904": {
            "id": "730320904",
            "speakerId": 20578,
            "speakerName": "Aranaga",
            "text": "The forest will remember, but...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730320905"
            ]
          },
          "730320905": {
            "id": "730320905",
            "speakerId": 20577,
            "speakerName": "Aragaru",
            "text": "I pray that no wind shall blow away our happiness; that there shall be rain to wet the earth and keep our Nara friends a while longer..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7303206",
      "subQuestName": "Look for Araja and Arama",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "730320601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "730320601": {
            "id": "730320601",
            "speakerId": 4184,
            "speakerName": "Araja",
            "text": "Oh my, I am so happy! I hope you will be happy too. Our greatest wish during Festival Utsava is to see our Nara friends happy.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730320602"
            ]
          },
          "730320602": {
            "id": "730320602",
            "speakerId": 4184,
            "speakerName": "Araja",
            "text": "Nara time is much more precious than Aranara time, so I will not keep you from enjoying yourselves. Go look for Arakavi later. He is also preparing for the Festival Utsava ceremony."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7303224",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "730320401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "730320401": {
            "id": "730320401",
            "speakerId": 20646,
            "speakerName": "Arama",
            "text": "The last Festival Utsava took place during Nara Varuna's time! In many tales and recollections, Marana was everywhere back then.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730320402"
            ]
          },
          "730320402": {
            "id": "730320402",
            "speakerId": 20646,
            "speakerName": "Arama",
            "text": "Trees died, and lush plains turned brown. It rained filthy red water... Red, not the lovely apple red. Very horrifying!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730320403"
            ]
          },
          "730320403": {
            "id": "730320403",
            "speakerId": 4184,
            "speakerName": "Araja",
            "text": "I'm glad I don't remember it now. Many children returned to Sarva before they were done growing into Vasara Trees. But there were still Nara Varuna and Festival Utsava.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730320404"
            ]
          },
          "730320404": {
            "id": "730320404",
            "speakerId": 20646,
            "speakerName": "Arama",
            "text": "Yes. At the time, you must have been a young Aranara sapling like me!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730320405"
            ]
          },
          "730320405": {
            "id": "730320405",
            "speakerId": 4184,
            "speakerName": "Araja",
            "text": "#Right. I have lost a lot of memories, but still can recall Nara's tears. Salty drops fell from {M#her}{F#his} eyes, but I wasn't afraid.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730320406"
            ]
          },
          "730320406": {
            "id": "730320406",
            "speakerId": 4184,
            "speakerName": "Araja",
            "text": "#{M#She}{F#He} spoke to me at length about our adventures in the forest, and thus the tales were preserved. Then, {M#she}{F#he} left.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730320407"
            ]
          },
          "730320407": {
            "id": "730320407",
            "speakerId": 4184,
            "speakerName": "Araja",
            "text": "#I wonder where {M#she}{F#he} is now? {M#She}{F#He} was very much like you, Nara {NICKNAME}. You two might be Nara, but you are shining like the warm, golden sun.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730320408"
            ]
          },
          "730320408": {
            "id": "730320408",
            "speakerId": 20646,
            "speakerName": "Arama",
            "text": "Drifting seeds are destined to flourish on nice soil... same for Nara! One day, the wind in Nara's hearts will stop, halting their steps.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730320409"
            ]
          },
          "730320409": {
            "id": "730320409",
            "speakerId": 20646,
            "speakerName": "Arama",
            "text": "#But Nara {NICKNAME} is not like ordinary Nara. Nara {NICKNAME} will keep traveling, and will perhaps run into Nara Varuna someday!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730320410"
            ]
          },
          "730320410": {
            "id": "730320410",
            "speakerId": 4184,
            "speakerName": "Araja",
            "text": "Yes, but you forgot, Arama, that Nara are not Aranara. Their time is short.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730320411"
            ]
          },
          "730320411": {
            "id": "730320411",
            "speakerId": 4184,
            "speakerName": "Araja",
            "text": "Nara Varuna couldn't live as long as trees, nor share dreams and memories as we do. How lonely and lamentable the Nara are.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730320412"
            ]
          },
          "730320412": {
            "id": "730320412",
            "speakerId": 20646,
            "speakerName": "Arama",
            "text": "#...Right. If only Nara {NICKNAME} were an Aranara! If so, we would've known each other from way before and shared so many memories.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730320413"
            ]
          },
          "730320413": {
            "id": "730320413",
            "speakerId": 4184,
            "speakerName": "Araja",
            "text": "The forest will remember. I'll bring all of Vanarana's memories to meet Aramuhukunda in Sarva, like rivers converging into the sea.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730320414"
            ]
          },
          "730320414": {
            "id": "730320414",
            "speakerId": 4184,
            "speakerName": "Araja",
            "text": "A very long time ago, Vanarana was destroyed in that Nara catastrophe. Since then, Aranara made dreams their home and distanced themselves from Nara.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730320415"
            ]
          },
          "730320415": {
            "id": "730320415",
            "speakerId": 4184,
            "speakerName": "Araja",
            "text": "Only Nara Varuna has always been friends with Aranara and continued helping everyone after the destruction. Only then did Aranara trust Nara again, little by little.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730320416"
            ]
          },
          "730320416": {
            "id": "730320416",
            "speakerId": 4184,
            "speakerName": "Araja",
            "text": "#When we parted, {M#she}{F#he} told me that, maybe one day, another Golden Nara would come to us, and {M#he}{F#she} would bring us even better memories.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730320417"
            ]
          },
          "730320417": {
            "id": "730320417",
            "speakerId": 4184,
            "speakerName": "Araja",
            "text": "#I think that with you and Nara {NICKNAME}, perhaps it's time for us to walk, sing, and play with Nara in the forests once again.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730320418"
            ]
          },
          "730320418": {
            "id": "730320418",
            "speakerId": 20646,
            "speakerName": "Arama",
            "text": "#But everybody trusts Nara {NICKNAME} and Paimon because they're genuinely good. It wouldn't be a problem if all Nara are nice like Nara {NICKNAME} and Nara Varuna!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730320419"
            ]
          },
          "730320419": {
            "id": "730320419",
            "speakerId": 20646,
            "speakerName": "Arama",
            "text": "You sound like an old Nara, Araja!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730320420"
            ]
          },
          "730320420": {
            "id": "730320420",
            "speakerId": 4184,
            "speakerName": "Araja",
            "text": "Oh, I'm very happy to have the festival and give the flowers to the Golden Nara, but I'm also reminded of a lot of other things...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730320421"
            ]
          },
          "730320421": {
            "id": "730320421",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Arama, Araja! What are you doing here?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730320422"
            ]
          },
          "730320422": {
            "id": "730320422",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#Don't tell Paimon you ran away because you didn't like how {NICKNAME} played?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730320423"
            ]
          },
          "730320423": {
            "id": "730320423",
            "speakerId": 20646,
            "speakerName": "Arama",
            "text": "#No! Nara {NICKNAME}'s performance was a bright ray of sunshine. It felt very, very good.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730320424"
            ]
          },
          "730320424": {
            "id": "730320424",
            "speakerId": 20646,
            "speakerName": "Arama",
            "text": "#But the Bija is crucial to Arana's and Nara {NICKNAME}'s wish, so I had to get ready.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730320425"
            ]
          },
          "730320425": {
            "id": "730320425",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Oh yeah, the Bija...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730320429",
              "730320428"
            ]
          },
          "730320429": {
            "id": "730320429",
            "speakerId": 20646,
            "speakerName": "Arama",
            "text": "I went looking for the Fane of Ashvattha right after the song ended.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730320430"
            ]
          },
          "730320430": {
            "id": "730320430",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "That sounds like it had something to do with the concourses we visited before.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730320431"
            ]
          },
          "730320431": {
            "id": "730320431",
            "speakerId": 4184,
            "speakerName": "Araja",
            "text": "Paimon is as bright as moonlight. That's where Ashvattha's Tree of Dreams is. It's an ancient, sturdy Vasara Tree that's able to produce Bija.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730320432"
            ]
          },
          "730320432": {
            "id": "730320432",
            "speakerId": 4184,
            "speakerName": "Araja",
            "text": "However, I don't remember the location, nor am I able to leave Vanarana's dream, so it's all up to Arama to find it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730320433"
            ]
          },
          "730320433": {
            "id": "730320433",
            "speakerId": 20646,
            "speakerName": "Arama",
            "text": "#Worry not. Like Nara {NICKNAME} and Paimon would say, \"I got this!\""
          },
          "730320428": {
            "id": "730320428",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#Paimon blames it on Festival Utsava feast that {NICKNAME} made. It was so delicious that Paimon got distracted."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
